<script lang="ts">
 import { Table } from '@nqmcreative/ui/matte';
 const send = `curl "$API_URL/messages" \\\n  -H "Authorization: Bearer $API_KEY" \\\n  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \\\n  -d '{"sessionId":"SESSION_ID","recipient":"62812xxxxxxxx","text":"Halo","idempotencyKey":"request-001"}'`;
 const endpoints = [['GET','/health','Kesehatan API'],['GET','/sessions','Daftar sesi'],['POST','/sessions','Buat sesi: { name }'],['GET','/sessions/:id/status','Status koneksi'],['POST','/sessions/:id/start','Mulai koneksi / QR'],['POST','/sessions/:id/reconnect','Sambung ulang'],['POST','/sessions/:id/logout','Logout WhatsApp'],['POST','/messages','Kirim teks'],['GET','/messages/logs','Log: sessionId, status, before, beforeId']];
 const columns = [{key:'method',label:'Metode'},{key:'path',label:'Endpoint'},{key:'label',label:'Fungsi'}];
 const rows = endpoints.map(([method,path,label])=>({id:path+method,method,path,label}));
</script>
<svelte:head><title>Panduan API · waflow</title></svelte:head>
<h1 class="font-heading text-3xl font-medium tracking-tight">Panduan API</h1>
<section class="mt-8 border border-hairline bg-bg p-6"><h2 class="font-heading text-xl">Autentikasi</h2><p class="mt-3 text-sm">Buat API key di <a href="/app/settings" class="text-brand hover:underline">Pengaturan</a>. Kirim header <code>Authorization: Bearer API_KEY</code>.</p><p class="mt-3 text-sm">API_URL adalah alamat Worker API, bukan alamat dashboard.</p></section>
<section class="mt-6 border border-hairline bg-bg p-6"><h2 class="font-heading text-xl">Kirim teks</h2><pre class="mt-4 overflow-x-auto border border-hairline bg-bg-alt p-4 text-xs"><code>{send}</code></pre><p class="mt-4 text-sm">Respons 202 berarti masuk antrean. Gunakan idempotencyKey yang sama saat mengulang permintaan yang responsnya hilang; periksa hasil melalui log atau webhook.</p></section>
<section class="mt-6 border border-hairline bg-bg"><Table {columns} {rows}>{#snippet cell({column,value})}{#if column.key==='label'}{value}{:else}<code>{value}</code>{/if}{/snippet}</Table></section>
<section class="mt-6 border border-hairline bg-bg p-6"><h2 class="font-heading text-xl">Webhook</h2><p class="mt-3 text-sm">Konfigurasi per sesi di <a href="/app/webhooks" class="text-brand hover:underline">Webhook</a>. Event: MESSAGES_UPSERT, MESSAGES_UPDATE, SEND_MESSAGE, CONNECTION_UPDATE.</p><p class="mt-3 text-sm">Verifikasi X-Waflow-Signature: HMAC-SHA256(secret, timestamp + "." + body mentah). Ambil timestamp dari X-Waflow-Timestamp, tolak timestamp kedaluwarsa, dan deduplikasi eventId. Secret hanya tampil sekali saat disimpan.</p><p class="mt-3 text-sm">Endpoint harus HTTPS publik dan mengembalikan 2xx. Delivery dicoba maksimal tiga kali; redirect tidak diikuti.</p></section>
